  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Tale of Two Lovers</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catraâ€™s cheeks were still red and she had a radiant expression as she gradually caught her breath after their sensual pleasures. Adora could have stayed there for hours just looking at her. In this instant, everything seemed perfect â€“ well, almost.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There were some thin shadows in the back of her mind. For example, Catra was her best friendâ€™s wife and her own husband and kids were waiting for her at home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It wasnâ€™t totally perfect, but what could go wrong?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Litteratruc</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
